 "description": "A bright and spacious two bedroom maisonette set over three floors on a highly sought-after residential road moments from London Fields.\n\nBenefiting from its own private entrance and a secluded garden, the property offers well-balanced accommodation including a generous reception room, fitted kitchen with dining space, two double bedrooms, a family bathroom and an additional cloakroom. The ground floor also features an entrance hall with excellent built-in storage.\n\nIdeally located close to Broadway Market, Wilton Way and London Fields Lido, with a fantastic selection of independent cafés, restaurants, bars and shops nearby. London Fields Overground Station is a short walk away, providing swift access to Liverpool Street, while Hackney Central, Hackney Downs, Dalston and numerous bus routes offer excellent transport connections across London.",
